  "id": "section-261",
  "title": "在抗大第二期开学典礼上的演讲",
  "level": 0,
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/2-110.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>109）</b>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n　　抗大像一块磨刀石，把那些小资产阶级意识，一一感情冲动，粗暴浮躁，没有耐心等等，磨他个精光，把自己变成一把雪亮的钢刀，去创造新社会，去打倒日本。<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/2-109.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/2-111.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
